  "2026-07-31T23:07:57.955Z","harness:codex","Scope disposition 2026-08-01: this tranche is implementing the upstream budget reachability, cursor-chain amortization, and egress receipt semantics first. The usage-ledger correction requires the SDK-owned context/next extraction still open on pm-z5pmf8 so it can consume the exact post-egress delivered rows without adding a second projection pass inside CLI commands. Leaving this distinct data-quality item open and unclaimed; no source edit is being made for it in this PR."
